        "node_id": "n_1_c3e6b1",
        "thought_text": "Analyze the parity of A and B directly. If either A or B is even, the product will always be even regardless of C, so output No. If both are odd, choose C=1 (which is odd) to make the product odd, so output Yes.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
