        "node_id": "n_2_d8a7b9",
        "thought_text": "Iterate through all possible values of C from 1 to 3. For each C, calculate the product A*B*C and check if it is odd. If any C satisfies the condition, print Yes and stop; otherwise, print No after checking all.",
